        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ರಾಜಕೀಯ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ರಾಜಕೀಯ — rājakīya — \"politics; political\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನನ್ನ ಅಜ್ಜನಿಗೆ ರಾಜಕೀಯದಲ್ಲಿ ಆಸಕ್ತಿ ಇಲ್ಲ. nanna ajjanige rājakīyadalli āsakti illa. My grandfather has no interest in politics."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "As an adjective: ರಾಜಕೀಯ (rājakīya) ಸುದ್ದಿ, political news."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ರಾಜಕೀಯ (rājakīya) is borrowed from Sanskrit rājakīya, \"belonging to a king, royal\" (Monier-Williams); Kannada uses it for politics."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
