          "title": "You'll want to know: ರಾಜಕಾರಣಿ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ರಾಜಕಾರಣಿ — rājakāraṇi — \"a politician\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆ ರಾಜಕಾರಣಿ ಹಳ್ಳಿಗಳಿಗೆ ಹೋಗಿ ಜನರ ಜೊತೆ ಮಾತಾಡಿದನು. ā rājakāraṇi haḷḷigaḷige hōgi janara jote mātāḍidanu. That politician went to the villages and talked with people."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ರಾಜಕಾರಣಿಗಳು, rājakāraṇigaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ರಾಜಕಾರಣ, politics, + -ಇ, the one who does it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ರಾಜಕಾರಣಿ (rājakāraṇi) is a modern Kannada word built on rājakāraṇa, \"politics\", from Sanskrit rāja, \"king\", and kāraṇa, \"cause, means\" (CDIAL 3057)."
            }
          ]
        },
